-      "description": "What: Reconcile the Claude launch contract and preflight (M)\n\nSource review: dev/local/reviews/00006-events-claude-adapter-v1-review-1.md (HEAD 24fcec3bed6a41044c3d149d1f42bd678864e7e0)\n\nLocation:\n- src/ovcaq/drivers/claude.py\n- tests/drivers/test_claude.py\n- tests/drivers/test_claude_process.py\n- tests/workflow/test_configuration.py\n\nDetails:\nCorrect the task-transmission gaps against the accepted design: use the configuration option fallback_model (resolve through the selected agent tier map) and raw_format='claude-stream-json-v1'; do not add compatibility aliases. Preserve the PRD's exact --permission-mode auto and fixed unattended defaults. Other non-secret environment additions come from explicit per-agent configuration; no personal WARDEN_UNATTENDED literal belongs in driver constants or a special allowlist. Configuration credential validation remains mandatory. Include the configured unattended permission mode in DriverHealth.detail for a loud preflight. LaunchSpec.env remains an overlay: do not copy the host environment here. Add exact argv/env/raw-format/preflight regressions.\n\n### Findings (verbatim)\n- \ud83d\udfe0 High The Claude adapter implements `fallback_tier` and emits raw format `stream-json`, while the accepted contract specifies the `fallback_model` option and `claude-stream-json-v1`; existing tests pin the divergent behavior | File: src/ovcaq/drivers/claude.py:40 | Consensus: 1/3 | Found by: ALICE\n- \ud83d\udfe1 The env allowlist hard-codes the personal key WARDEN_UNATTENDED and rejects every other non-CLAUDE_ key from per-agent config. The PRD says other additions (for example WARDEN_UNATTENDED) \"come from per-agent configuration, never from driver constants\" | File: src/ovcaq/drivers/claude.py:60 | Consensus: 1/3 | Found by: BOB\n- \u26aa There is no \"loud preflight\" for unattended permissions. A missing mode fails loudly, but when the mode is configured, probe()/DriverHealth.detail never mentions the unattended permission mode (plan \u00a715) | File: src/ovcaq/drivers/claude.py:75 | Consensus: 1/3 | Found by: BOB\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Every quoted finding no longer reproduces.\n- Preserve raw evidence, provider-neutral shared models, state authority and shell-free command construction.\n- Run focused regression tests and the work skill's mandatory final verification; do not perform completion review in the implementation session.\n",
