dds no coverage | File: src/ovcaq/runtime/session.py:140 | Consensus: 1/3 | Found by: BOB\n- \ud83d\udfe1 Tautological test: test_fake_driver_summary_agrees_with_shared_reduction compares a test-local FakeDriver.summarize, which is literally reduce_session(...).summary, with reduce_session and cannot fail | File: tests/drivers/test_contract.py:329 | Consensus: 1/3 | Found by: BOB\n- \u26aa The neutrality guard scans only events/, runtime/, tui/ and drivers/base.py. It skips workflow/, state/, cli*.py and config.py, where P05 routing lands, so the AGENTS.md provider-neutral rule is only partly enforced | File: tests/drivers/test_neutrality.py:5 | Consensus: 1/3 | Found by: BOB\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Every quoted finding no longer reproduces.\n- Preserve raw evidence, provider-neutral shared models, state authority and shell-free command construction.\n- Run focused regression tests and the work skill's mandatory final verification; do not perform completion review in the implementation session.\n",
